#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:2
msgid "KV Cache SDK"
msgstr "KV Cache SDK"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LMCache **SDK** lets you retrieve a request's KV cache from a LMCache"
" server, transform it on the CPU, and store it back. This can be used for"
" KV cache transformations, such as token dropping. In the example: we "
"prefill a batch of long prompts, drop half of each request's KV chunks, "
"and show the decode-throughput gain. The SDK API is meant for offline "
"setup. The full runnable notebook lives at `examples/token_dropping "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/examples/token_dropping>`_."
msgstr "LMCache **SDK** 允许您从 LMCache 服务器检索请求的 KV 缓存，在 CPU 上进行转换，然后再存储回去。这可以用于 KV 缓存转换，例如丢弃令牌。在示例中：我们预填充一批长提示，丢弃每个请求的一半 KV 块，并展示解码吞吐量的提升。SDK API 旨在用于离线设置。完整的可运行笔记本位于 `examples/token_dropping <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/examples/token_dropping>`_。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:18
msgid "Why KV Cache SDK"
msgstr "为什么选择 KV Cache SDK"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Improving Decode Throughput** when shrinking KV cache using token "
"dropping. Token dropping reduces the KV cache size, allowing more "
"requests to fit in a batch, improving decode throughput. Doing so will "
"affect the accuracy minimally, as we demonstrated with the SnapKV example"
" in the `examples/token_dropping/snapkv_token_dropping.ipynb "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/examples/token_dropping/snapkv_token_dropping.ipynb>`_."
msgstr "**通过丢弃令牌来提高解码吞吐量**。丢弃令牌可以缩小 KV 缓存的大小，使更多请求能够适应一个批次，从而提高解码吞吐量。这样做对准确性的影响很小，正如我们在 `examples/token_dropping/snapkv_token_dropping.ipynb <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/examples/token_dropping/snapkv_token_dropping.ipynb>`_ 中用 SnapKV 示例所演示的那样。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:27
msgid ""
"The SDK gives you the hooks to retrieve a request's KV and other "
"intermediate tensors (currently only query tensors), supply your function"
" to edit the KV, and store the edited KV back. The SDK also provides a "
"batched-stream API to prefill, modify, and store the cache back before "
"decoding continues."
msgstr "SDK 提供了钩子来检索请求的 KV 及其他中间张量（目前仅支持查询张量），您可以提供自己的函数来编辑 KV，并将编辑后的 KV 存储回去。SDK 还提供了一个批量流 API，以便在继续解码之前进行预填充、修改并将缓存存储回去。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:32
msgid ""
"Since many token dropping algorithms rely on the intermediate tensors, we"
" also provided a flag to transfer the intermediate tensors from vLLM to "
"LMCache. Currently, the SDK only supports transferring query intermediate"
" tensors."
msgstr "由于许多丢弃令牌的算法依赖于中间张量，我们还提供了一个标志，以便将中间张量从 vLLM 转移到 LMCache。目前，SDK 仅支持转移查询中间张量。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:38
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "它是如何工作的"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:40
msgid "A request flows through three phases on the batched-stream API:"
msgstr "请求在批处理流 API 上经历三个阶段："

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:42
msgid ""
"**prefill** — run each prompt through vLLM once (``max_tokens=1``); vLLM "
"computes the KV cache and stores it in LMCache."
msgstr ""
"**预取** — 将每个提示通过 vLLM 运行一次（``max_tokens=1``）；vLLM 计算 KV Cache 并将其存储在 "
"LMCache 中。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:44
msgid ""
"**modify** — the SDK retrieves the cached KV to CPU, hands it to your "
"edit function, and stores the result back."
msgstr "**修改** — SDK 将缓存的 KV 取回到 CPU，交给你的编辑函数，并将结果存储回去。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:46
msgid "**decode** — continue generation against the smaller, edited cache."
msgstr "**解码** — 在更小的、编辑过的缓存上继续生成。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:48
msgid ""
"The SDK runs on **CPU** and hands you KV tensors in ``HND`` order with "
"shape ``[2, L, T, D]`` (K/V, layers, chunk-aligned tokens, ``num_kv_heads"
" * head_dim``)."
msgstr ""
"SDK 在 **CPU** 上运行，并以 ``HND`` 顺序提供形状为 ``[2, L, T, D]`` 的 KV "
"张量（K/V、层、块对齐的标记、``num_kv_heads * head_dim``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:53
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:55
msgid ""
"The SDK runs on CPU and talks to the server over the engine-driven "
"transfer path, which the server does not load by default -- start the "
"server with ``--supported-transfer-mode auto`` so both the vLLM (lmcache-"
"driven) and SDK (engine-driven) paths are available. The SDK request "
"client supports either ZMQ or gRPC. Its ``url`` scheme and the vLLM "
"connector endpoint must match the server's ``--transport`` setting. To "
"enable shared-memory transfer, pass ``--shm-name`` and disable lazy L1 "
"allocation with ``--no-l1-use-lazy``. If shared memory is unavailable and"
" these flags are not specified, the SDK falls back to the typed inline "
"tensor codec. To transfer query tensors, load the opt-in ``qstore`` "
"server module with ``--server-module``. It requires the LMCache-driven "
"transfer path (``--supported-transfer-mode lmcache_driven`` or ``auto``) "
"and advertises the ``transfer_query`` experimental feature, which the "
"connector checks before it starts capturing query tensors."
msgstr "SDK 在 CPU 上运行，并通过引擎驱动的传输路径与服务器通信，该路径默认情况下不加载服务器 -- 使用 ``--supported-transfer-mode auto`` 启动服务器，以便 vLLM（基于 lmcache 的）和 SDK（基于引擎的）路径都可用。SDK 请求客户端支持 ZMQ 或 gRPC。其 ``url`` 方案和 vLLM 连接器端点必须与服务器的 ``--transport`` 设置匹配。要启用共享内存传输，请传递 ``--shm-name`` 并使用 ``--no-l1-use-lazy`` 禁用懒惰的 L1 分配。如果共享内存不可用且未指定这些标志，SDK 将回退到类型内联张量编解码器。要传输查询张量，请使用 ``--server-module`` 加载可选的 ``qstore`` 服务器模块。它需要基于 LMCache 的传输路径（``--supported-transfer-mode lmcache_driven`` 或 ``auto``），并宣传 ``transfer_query`` 实验性功能，连接器在开始捕获查询张量之前会检查该功能。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:84
msgid "Then start vLLM with the LMCache MP connector."
msgstr "然后使用 LMCache MP 连接器启动 vLLM。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:100
msgid ""
"To also send intermediate tensors, add "
"``\"lmcache.mp.transfer_intermediate_tensors\": true`` to "
"``kv_connector_extra_config``. By default, the QRingBuffer, a temporary "
"staging buffer for containing query tensor, has the capacity to hold the "
"query tensor of 2 forward passes. However, it can also be configured via "
"``\"lmcache.mp.q.ring_depth\":2``. Example:"
msgstr "要同时发送中间张量，请将 ``\"lmcache.mp.transfer_intermediate_tensors\": true`` 添加到 ``kv_connector_extra_config`` 中。默认情况下，QRingBuffer 是一个临时的暂存缓冲区，用于存放查询张量，能够容纳 2 次前向传递的查询张量。然而，它也可以通过 ``\"lmcache.mp.q.ring_depth\":2`` 进行配置。示例："

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:127
msgid ""
"The SDK keys the KV cache by token ids: ``create_request`` takes the "
"prompt as token ids, and every ``post_completion`` must report a "
"``token_id`` for each generated token. The example gets these ids "
"straight from vLLM by passing ``--return-tokens-as-token-ids``. "
"Otherwise, if vLLM returns only text, the ``post_completion`` must "
"tokenize each generated token back into a token id."
msgstr ""
"SDK通过令牌 ID 对 KV Cache 进行键控：``create_request`` 将提示作为令牌 ID，且每个 "
"``post_completion`` 必须报告每个生成令牌的 ``token_id``。该示例通过传递 ``--return-tokens-"
"as-token-ids`` 直接从 vLLM 获取这些 ID。否则，如果 vLLM 仅返回文本，则 ``post_completion`` "
"必须将每个生成的令牌重新标记为令牌 ID。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:133
msgid ""
"Here's an example of creating a context and connecting to the LMCache "
"server. Each type of tensor (KV, query intermediate) has its own context."
msgstr "这是创建上下文并连接到 LMCache 服务器的示例。每种类型的张量（KV、查询中间）都有其自己的上下文。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:158
msgid "Writing a custom edit function"
msgstr "编写自定义编辑函数"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:160
msgid ""
"An edit function takes the Mapping[kind, retrieved tensor] and its token "
"ids and returns the edited ``(kv, tokens)``. ``batch.modify(fn)`` applies"
" it for every requests. The function should be implemented as if it's "
"only for single request, and the SDK will call it in parallel for every "
"requests in the batch."
msgstr "编辑函数接受 Mapping[kind, retrieved tensor] 及其令牌 ID，并返回编辑后的 ``(kv, tokens)``。``batch.modify(fn)`` 会对每个请求应用该函数。该函数应当实现为仅针对单个请求，SDK 会并行调用它以处理批次中的每个请求。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:165
msgid ""
"``modify`` operates only on the **chunk-aligned** prefix. A trailing "
"partial chunk is tracked by the SDK and re-sent on the next ``decode``, "
"so ``tokens`` arrives already truncated to the cached length."
msgstr ""
"``modify`` 仅在 **块对齐** 前缀上操作。尾部的部分块由 SDK 跟踪，并在下一个 ``解码`` 时重新发送，因此 "
"``tokens`` 已经被截断到缓存的长度。"

