"``LMCacheBatchedStreamError`` if the id is unknown."
msgstr "通过其 ``request_stream_id`` 获取已注册的请求流。如果该 ID 不存在，则引发 ``LMCacheBatchedStreamError``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:279
msgid "``batch.prefill(sampling_params)``"
msgstr "``batch.prefill(sampling_params)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:280
msgid ""
"Prefill every request stream once (``max_tokens`` forced to 1). Returns "
"``Metrics``."
msgstr "每个请求流预填充一次（``max_tokens`` 强制为 1）。返回 ``Metrics``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:282
msgid "``batch.modify(fn)``"
msgstr "``batch.modify(fn)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:283
msgid ""
"Apply the edit function ``fn`` to every request stream's cached KV. "
"Returns ``Metrics``."
msgstr "将编辑函数 ``fn`` 应用到每个请求流的缓存 KV。返回 ``Metrics``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:285
msgid "``batch.decode(sampling_params)``"
msgstr "``batch.decode(sampling_params)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:286
msgid "Decode every request stream. Returns ``Metrics``."
msgstr "解码每个请求流。返回 ``Metrics``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:287
msgid "``metrics.emit()``"
msgstr "``metrics.emit()``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:288
msgid ""
"Print the ``Metrics`` report through its registered handlers (a terminal "
"table by default)."
msgstr "通过其注册的处理程序（默认是终端表）打印 ``Metrics`` 报告。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:290
msgid "``metrics.to_dict()``"
msgstr "``metrics.to_dict()``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:291
msgid ""
"Return the ``Metrics`` report as a JSON-serialisable dict, keyed by "
"``\"title\"`` and ``\"metrics\"``."
msgstr "返回 ``Metrics`` 报告，作为一个可序列化为 JSON 的字典，键为 ``\"title\"`` 和 ``\"metrics\"``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:294
msgid ""
"``Metrics`` reports ``input_tokens`` / ``input_tput`` for prefill, "
"``duration`` for modify, and ``output_tokens`` / ``output_tput`` for "
"decode."
msgstr "``Metrics`` 报告 ``input_tokens`` / ``input_tput`` 用于 Prefill，``duration`` 用于修改，以及 ``output_tokens`` / ``output_tput`` 用于解码。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:298
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:304
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:306
msgid "``batch.request_streams``"
msgstr "``batch.request_streams``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:307
msgid ""
"``dict`` of every registered ``LMCacheRequestStream``, keyed by "
"``request_stream_id``. Iterate it to read each request's ``output_text`` "
"/ ``output_tokens`` after decode."
msgstr "每个注册的 ``LMCacheRequestStream`` 的 ``dict``，以 ``request_stream_id`` 为键。遍历它以在解码后读取每个请求的 ``output_text`` / ``output_tokens``。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:310
msgid "``batch.perf_metrics``"
msgstr "``batch.perf_metrics``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:311
msgid ""
"``dict`` of the latest ``StreamPerfMetrics`` per ``request_stream_id``. "
"Cleared and repopulated by each ``prefill`` / ``decode``."
msgstr "每个 ``request_stream_id`` 的最新 ``StreamPerfMetrics`` 的 ``dict``。每次 ``prefill`` / ``decode`` 时清除并重新填充。"

